      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing Urza's Saga before Ifnir Deadlands means the player must crack Prismatic Vista this turn to produce {B} for Thoughtseize, wasting the fetch land early. Ifnir Deadlands would have provided {B} immediately (at 1 life) while preserving Prismatic Vista for a future turn when it could be more valuable.",
