      "decision_index": 141,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Fatal Push cannot stop Phlage from entering the battlefield and triggering its ETB ability (deal 3 damage, gain 3 life). Phlage is on the stack being cast - Fatal Push destroys creatures on the battlefield, it doesn't counter spells. Furthermore, Phlage enters and must be sacrificed unless it escaped, so it will die on its own anyway. Even if the intent was to kill it after it resolves, Phlage is a 6/6 which exceeds Fatal Push's mana value limit (MV 3), making it an illegal target. Additionally, Phlage will sacrifice itself upon entering since it wasn't escaped (cast from graveyard with escape cost). This Fatal Push is completely wasted - it either has no legal target or targets a creature that's about to sacrifice itself anyway.",
