      "snapshot_index": 256,
      "player": "Haiku Coach",
      "decision_index": 583,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Haiku Coach is at 5 life facing an opponent at 36 life with an empty hand and no creatures on board. They have Urza's Saga available to create a Construct token (which would grow with Shadowspear as an artifact on board, making it at least a 2/2), and they have the mana to activate it ({2}, {T}). Creating a Construct token is pure upside - it provides a body that can be equipped with Shadowspear for lifelink to stabilize, or serve as a blocker/attacker. With Shadowspear already on board, the Construct would be at least 2/2 (counting itself and Shadowspear as artifacts). Passing the turn and skipping the attack phase without using available mana to create a threat wastes a critical turn when behind.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Urza's Saga to create a Construct token, then skipped the attack phase.",
      "better_line": "Activate Urza's Saga to create a Construct token (at least 2/2 with Shadowspear as another artifact), then on subsequent turns equip Shadowspear for a 3/3 lifelink trampler to try to race back into the game.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 258,
      "player": "Haiku Coach",
      "decision_index": 586,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Haiku Coach declined to activate Urza's Saga Chapter II to create a Construct token despite having untapped mana available. At 5 life vs 36 life with an empty hand, every resource matters. The Construct would be at least a 1/1 (with Shadowspear as the only artifact) and could serve as a blocker or Shadowspear carrier.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without activating any abilities",
      "better_line": "Activate Urza's Saga ({2}, {T}) to create a Construct token, providing an additional body for blocking or equipping Shadowspear",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 259,
      "player": "Haiku Coach",
      "decision_index": 587,
    }
  ],
